After creating a multi-sampled OpenGL context, you can use glRenderbufferStorageMultisample and glBlitFramebuffer to enable full scene anti-aliasing:

```cpp
GLuint multiSampleFBO, multiSampleRBO;
glGenFramebuffers(1, &multiSampleFBO);
glGenRenderbuffers(1, &multiSampleRBO);

glBindFramebuffer(GL_FRAMEBUFFER, multiSampleFBO);
glBindRenderbuffer(GL_RENDERBUFFER, multiSampleRBO);
glRenderbufferStorageMultisample(GL_RENDERBUFFER, 4 /*samples*/, GL_RGBA8, width, height);
glFramebufferRenderbuffer(GL_FRAMEBUFFER, GL_COLOR_ATTACHMENT0, GL_RENDERBUFFER, multiSampleRBO);

// Then render your scene...

